ight or might not, but we have enough evidence.\n\nAlternatively, maybe the rabbit does spare the lion because the lion is mean and the rabbit is mean, but that does necessarily mean the rabbit would spare the lion. The only sparing mentioned is the rabbit sparing the dog.. Therefore, the option is ']]
